# Pascal sources: normalize as text (LF in repo), platform-native in working tree
*.pas  text
*.pp   text
*.inc  text

# Project + docs
*.lpi  text
*.lpr  text
*.xml  text
*.json text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text
*.toml text
*.cfg  text
*.ini  text
*.txt  text
*.md   text
Makefile text

# Scripts
